	(text "Decoupling per UG-637: 100 nF + 10 nF at each supply pin, same side as U1, via under the 100 nF pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cdb486a8-9071-499c-976d-de373d9a71c4")
	)
	(text "Analog input (UG-637 Fig. 8): 75 R termination (R1+R2), gain 0.7, AC coupled by C1.\nJ2: RCA jack, hand-soldered (not in JLCPCB catalog)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "be38816a-6309-48b9-ac99-4f177a4af12e")
	)
	(text "Crystal 28.63636 MHz, fundamental, CL 20 pF:\nC = 2(CL-Cs)-Cpg = 2(20-3)-4 = 30 pF -> 27 pF (AN-1260)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "edc3d21a-abc4-466d-b7e7-f4d1d3f02009")
	)
	(text "MIPI CSI-2, 1 data lane + clock (216 Mbps interlaced / 432 Mbps I2P).\nRoute as 100 R differential (2 x 50 R loosely coupled per UG-637), no vias, GND plane under."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "69e58b0f-6b8c-4bc2-9ad1-219766ec7f3d")
	)
	(text "THS7314 BUFFER STAGE - separable section (breakaway tabs, see PCB)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ae1ce087-2670-479a-8df6-b9fdc927c98b")
	)
	(text "5 V from the external DC-DC module via J4 (screw terminal); the Pi 4 is powered from the same 5 V by its own cable.\nOnly two copper links cross the tabs: CVBS_IN and GND. Snap off -> J8 -> cable -> J2 (RCA) on the decoder board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "52e148eb-7eb2-464f-8deb-6c4985cabcd7")
	)
	(text "Power: J4 -> D2 SS14 (reverse polarity, -0.4 V) -> C28 22 uF -> FB2 -> C27 10 uF + C26 100 nF at VS+ (SLOS513A: 0.1 uF at the pin, 22-100 uF on the line).\nTHS7314 runs from 3 to 5 V; at ~4.6 V the output swing (4.5 V typ into 75 R) leaves >2 V margin for 2 Vpp video + 0.29 V clamp offset. No LDO needed. Iq 17 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d8211d0-7be4-4e1f-b124-696c8a262276")
	)
	(text "Input (SLOS513A Fig. 33/34): R8 75 R termination, D3 ESD, C23-C25 100 nF series -> sync-tip clamp (DC restore) mode, one cap per input (each input has its own clamp).\nOutputs: gain 6 dB (x2), series 75 R into 75 R load -> unity overall. CH1 -> decoder (JP4 bridged), CH2/CH3 -> monitors J6/J7. Bandwidth 8.5 MHz (5th-order LPF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "28b7e19c-63ac-4db8-8ce2-fb012640a244")
	)
	(text "CVBS_IN: copper track across the breakaway tab to the decoder input node (J2 / D1 / R1). Cut JP4 to feed J2 directly while the boards are joined; when snapped off use J8."
